 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_67fd7f1e3e877ddfbee9",
   "sourceHash": "67fd7f1e3e877ddfbee9a43fb791b02426933d4964222b72965aa7c59d0ae062",
   "text": "Kairali 由 K.V. Ramesh 夫妇创立，二人至今仍是 Kairali 集团的首席导师；如今，新一代已稳稳立足于业务核心。他们真正传承了长辈及先辈的事业，期待助力公司让这一领先的阿育吠陀品牌在全球更广泛地传扬。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b6f296f364fdd1309d6b",
   "sourceHash": "b6f296f364fdd1309d6bcb17a141c83e35267d4de52e270bc7bb7db13e92eb54",
   "text": "首页 – Kairali 阿育吠陀设备",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba8a78fe03c8ad4bde2e",
   "sourceHash": "ba8a78fe03c8ad4bde2e0c91de92cf2a4b64bdd6e5f7876bec6fe72e64f29565",
   "text": "咨询服务",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce85dc1925e50a3e2dbc",
   "sourceHash": "ce85dc1925e50a3e2dbcecf2e9fb20635767f09f41aaffcd24350c2b7aaca68a",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 在传统阿育吠陀科学的生产与实践方面拥有 80 多年的专业经验，在阿育吠陀产品的生产和销售方面也有着扎实的业绩。团队赢得了印度国内外众多客户的信任与认可。我们是在全球运营阿育吠陀康养中心及健康中心的领先者。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Language lock: 'Ayurvedic Health retreats' rendered as 阿育吠陀康养中心 (wellness centres), no resort equivalent."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_38d993b0f8bb40120236",
   "sourceHash": "38d993b0f8bb40120236a48a4b786d8da130c034f5d132ae3becab976622509c",
   "text": "Kairali Ayurvedic Group 依托其阿育吠陀知识，始终致力于坚守先辈所确立的标准。集团为所有需要改进和提升运营的企业与机构提供咨询服务，并成功为众多知名企业提供全面指导，帮助其提升现有实践与标准。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6d4b0fa5fd75588a340e",
   "sourceHash": "6d4b0fa5fd75588a340e70a9de42380de142acd10fcbe3d36a475e6f594eeb16",
   "text": "Kairali 被誉为全球设计最优美的健康农庄，致力于为来访者提供周到的接待服务。Kairali 设有多个部门管理业务，咨询部门也在不断完善自身职能。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_faa4bf3d8dfd2e46f336",
   "sourceHash": "faa4bf3d8dfd2e46f336ff5ede976842ca074144ea745dd79ae5e39d86111252",
   "text": "商业计划展示，随后进行概念设计与财务建模。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
